# TopQuaranta cron table.
#
# Deployed to /etc/cron.d/topquaranta (owned by root, permissions 0644).
# Deploy with:
#
#     sudo install -o root -g root -m 644 \
#         deploy/cron.topquaranta /etc/cron.d/topquaranta
#
# cron(8) auto-reloads /etc/cron.d/* — no restart needed.
#
# Every command runs through `/home/topquaranta/bin/tq-run` which:
#   - captures the exit code + last output to /var/log/topquaranta/status/*.status
#     (read by tq-health for monitoring)
#   - retries up to 3 times with 60s/300s backoff (R7)
#
# Log files listed in `deploy/logrotate.topquaranta` are rotated weekly,
# kept 8 weeks, compressed.
#
# Times are UTC (the server runs Etc/UTC — see `cat /etc/timezone`).

SHELL=/bin/bash
PATH=/usr/local/bin:/usr/bin:/bin

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Hourly: ingest + metadata refresh
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Deezer novelty ingestion — every hour on the hour. Brings new
# tracks/albums/artists into the system; later steps key off this.
0 * * * *   topquaranta   /home/topquaranta/bin/tq-run obtenir_novetats >> /var/log/topquaranta/novetats.log 2>&1

# MusicBrainz metadata refresh — 30 min after novetats so it picks up
# the artists just ingested. Single-instance lock + queue-empty
# short-circuit make idle runs cheap. Rate-limited to 1 req/s.
# (Was every 15 min during the backfill phase — slimmed to hourly on
# 2026-04-25 once the backlog was drained.)
#
# `--limit 200` (added 2026-05-03) caps each tick at ~10 min of work
# so a sudden queue surge — e.g. a `obtenir_metadata --force` run that
# spawns dozens of pendent collaborators — drains over several ticks
# instead of one long lock-monopolising run that blocks the next 1-2
# scheduled invocations.
#
# Cap reduced 200 → 100 on 2026-05-05: artistes with huge MB
# discographies (synth-wave catalogues with 50+ albums) pushed real
# durations to 40+ min, occasionally 5 h. The hourly cadence + 30-min
# `ram_heavy` window means anything over 30 min collides with the next
# tick AND with the daily Whisper run. 100 caps comfortably under
# 17 min real time. Total throughput unchanged at the day level
# (~2400 artistes/24 h vs the cap of ~4800/day at 200) — and at our
# pendents queue size that's still 2× over-provisioned.
30 * * * *  topquaranta   /home/topquaranta/bin/tq-run obtenir_metadata_musicbrainz --limit 100 >> /var/log/topquaranta/mb.log 2>&1

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Nightly pipeline (UTC) — each step feeds the next
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# 02:00 → Self-hosted cover pipeline (Fase 1). Downloads Deezer
# covers and transcodes them to webp/avif/jpg variants under
# PORTADES_ROOT. No DB writes; state is the filesystem. Caps at 200
# entities/run, throttled ~0.4s between downloads. Caddy serving +
# SPA consumption land in later phases. See docs/architecture/portades.md.
0 2 * * *   topquaranta   /home/topquaranta/bin/tq-run descarregar_portades --entitat all --limit 200 >> /var/log/topquaranta/portades.log 2>&1

# 03:00 → PostgreSQL backup. Tiered retention in /home/topquaranta/backups/
0 3 * * *   postgres      /home/topquaranta/bin/tq-backup >> /var/log/topquaranta/backup.log 2>&1

# 03:30 → Offsite backup (capa 2): restic → Backblaze B2, append-only.
# GATED: inert (status=DISABLED, exit 0) until OFFSITE_BACKUP_ACTIU=1 +
# restic vars in the .env + restic installed. docs/ops/backup-offsite.md.
30 3 * * *  topquaranta   /home/topquaranta/bin/tq-backup-offsite >> /var/log/topquaranta/backup-offsite.log 2>&1

# 04:00 → Purge expired unverified tracks (older than DIES_CADUCITAT).
0 4 * * *   topquaranta   /home/topquaranta/bin/tq-run netejar_caducades >> /var/log/topquaranta/neteja.log 2>&1

# 04:00 → Whisper language ID on new tracks with Deezer previews.
# Backfill of the historical 6.7k catalogue finished 2026-04-25.
#
# Time slot moved 05:00 → 04:00 UTC (2026-05-05) and limit raised
# 100 → 200. Rationale:
#   - At 04:00 UTC the most recent MB tick is 03:30, which with the
#     reduced --limit 100 (above) finishes by ~03:47. Whisper has a
#     clean ~30 min window with `ram_heavy.lock` free before the
#     next MB tick at 04:30.
#   - --limit 200 (was 100) drains ingest backlog twice as fast on
#     the days when several hundred new tracks land at once. Worst
#     case duration: 200 × 27 s/track CPU ≈ 90 min, but that only
#     happens after a multi-day backlog. Steady-state 50-100 tracks
#     fits well within the MB-free window before 04:30.
0 4 * * *   topquaranta   /home/topquaranta/bin/tq-run analitzar_whisper --limit 200 >> /var/log/topquaranta/whisper.log 2>&1

# 05:00 → Last.fm artist metadata refresh. ~2 reqs/artist (info +
# similar), rate-limited to 0.2 s each ≈ 200 s for --limit 500. Runs
# in parallel with Whisper above (different processes, different
# locks); Last.fm finishes long before the 06:00 senyal step.
0 5 * * *   topquaranta   /home/topquaranta/bin/tq-run obtenir_metadata_lastfm --limit 500 >> /var/log/topquaranta/lastfm-meta.log 2>&1

# 06:00 → Last.fm signal ingestion. Stores raw playcount + listeners
# per (canço, data). No normalisation step (algorithm v2.0 reads the
# weekly delta of playcount directly).
0 6 * * *   topquaranta   /home/topquaranta/bin/tq-run obtenir_senyal >> /var/log/topquaranta/senyal.log 2>&1

# ── YouTube (segona font de senyal, fase d'implementació 2026-08) ──────
# El descobriment és el car: search.list val 100 de les 10.000 unitats
# diàries, o siga ~90 artistes per execució. Va a les 03:00 UTC perquè
# la quota de Google es reinicia a mitjanit del Pacífic (09:00 CEST a
# l'estiu) — així el pressupost del dia ja està sencer.
0 3 * * *   topquaranta   /home/topquaranta/bin/tq-run descobrir_youtube >> /var/log/topquaranta/youtube.log 2>&1
# La recollida diària costa ~60 unitats: després del descobriment, i
# abans que arribe l'informe.
30 6 * * *  topquaranta   /home/topquaranta/bin/tq-run obtenir_senyal_youtube >> /var/log/topquaranta/youtube.log 2>&1
# TEMPORAL — informe de progrés mentre dura la fase d'implementació.
# Per a apagar-lo: esborra aquesta línia i torna a executar tq-sync-infra.
0 7 * * *   topquaranta   /home/topquaranta/bin/tq-run enviar_informe_youtube >> /var/log/topquaranta/analytics.log 2>&1

# 06:45 → Anomaly detector. Reads today's SenyalDiari and flags
# `corregit=True` on any row whose day-over-day delta is wildly
# outside the cançó's recent baseline (default: floor=100 plays,
# multiplier=20× median). Catches Last.fm autocorrect/fallback
# changes that produce phantom playcount spikes (caught 2026-05-08:
# 53 live/remix/remasteritzada cançons spiked overnight when
# Last.fm collapsed variant queries onto the main recording).
# Runs before calcular_top so the ranking sees a clean signal set.
45 6 * * *  topquaranta   /home/topquaranta/bin/tq-run detectar_anomalies_senyal >> /var/log/topquaranta/senyal.log 2>&1

# 07:00 → Daily provisional ranking. Uses today's freshly-ingested signal.
0 7 * * *   topquaranta   /home/topquaranta/bin/tq-run calcular_top --provisional >> /var/log/topquaranta/top-provisional.log 2>&1

# Every 2h at :15 -> Process A (Spotify playlist sync, daily slice).
# --freq daily limits the sync to the daily-top + no_verificades rows;
# the weekly mirrors run on a separate slot (below). Cache-only since
# 2026-05-22: NEVER calls /v1/search. See docs/architecture/playlists.md
# (Process A) and ADR-0013 for the A/B split.
#
# Cadence (2026-05-23): 12×/day instead of 1×/day. Process A is
# cache-only since 2026-05-22 (no /v1/search, no rate-limit pressure)
# so running it every 2 h keeps the 12 playlists in lock-step with
# fresh ranking moves throughout the day instead of letting them
# drift for ~24 h between syncs. Each run only PUT/POSTs deltas vs
# the current playlist contents, so cost is bounded by churn.
15 */2 * * *  topquaranta   /home/topquaranta/bin/tq-run actualitzar_playlists_spotify --freq daily >> /var/log/topquaranta/playlists.log 2>&1

# Saturday 10:00 UTC -> Process A weekly slice. Mirrors the 5 weekly
# top playlists (PPCC + 4 territories) from TopSetmanal of the latest
# published setmana. 30 min after the Saturday 09:30 publicar_social
# slot so the social posts and the playlist update arrive close in
# time. Enabled 2026-05-23 after manual wet sync validated coverage
# at /staff/social/spotify/.
0 10 * * 6  topquaranta   /home/topquaranta/bin/tq-run actualitzar_playlists_spotify --freq weekly >> /var/log/topquaranta/playlists.log 2>&1

# 03:00 nightly -> Process B (Spotify enrichment). One-shot per
# Canço: search ISRC -> fetch track + artist -> persist
# SpotifyMetadata. Throttled so the per-minute /search budget stays
# clear and the per-tick runtime stays under any reasonable cron
# slot.
#
# Cadence change (2026-05-24): moved from hourly to nightly daily.
# Observed real volume: ~21 new Cançons/day (rolling 14d average);
# the prior hourly cron made 24 runs x up to 150 calls/day worst
# case for 1.2k candidate budget vs 21 actual new tracks/day. The
# 57x over-provisioning was draining the historical not_attempted
# backlog (3.3k rows) but also kept tripping Spotify's daily quota,
# producing 18h Retry-After windows roughly once per day. Slot moved
# to 03:00 UTC so the enrichment finishes before the 04:00 Whisper
# run and well before the first `actualitzar_playlists_spotify`
# tick at 04:15, so the day's playlists see the freshly-enriched
# spotify_ids on the first sync of the day.
#
# Budget under the new cadence (2026-06: throughput raise):
#   --limit 250   cap of 250 candidates/tick -> ~750 API calls/day
#                 worst case (search + track + artist per canco).
#   --throttle 0.5 2 req/s ceiling -> ~120 req/min, well under Spotify's
#                 ~180 req/30s rolling window over a ~7-10 min batch.
# Backlog at 50/day was ~31 days for the 1.5k not_attempted; 250/day
# drains it in ~6 days. Conservative vs `enriquir_spotify_rebuigs`'s
# AIMD controller (which ramps to 800). Candidate ordering is now
# priority-tiered (top -> provisional -> pending -> rest), so charting
# songs are enriched first regardless of the cap. See
# docs/architecture/playlists.md (Process B) and ADR-0013.
0 3 * * *   topquaranta   /home/topquaranta/bin/tq-run enriquir_spotify --limit 250 --throttle 0.5 >> /var/log/topquaranta/playlists.log 2>&1

# 05:00 nightly -> Process B backfill of historical rebuigs.
# Enriches Cançons that carry a rebuig HR row but no Spotify
# metadata yet, so the per-(deezer_id, spotify_artist_id) ML
# rejection-ratio feature gains coverage on the rows that drive
# it (the homonym-suspect Deezer profiles). Wet-run validated
# 2026-05-26 on PR #96 + first prod run (19/19 enriched, no
# 429).
#
# --shortlist-only restricts to cançons whose artista_deezer_id
# has at least one `desvincular_album` rebuig. Those are the
# Deezer-collapsed homonyms where disambiguating by Spotify
# artist actually changes the ML signal; the wider rebuig
# universe gets no useful information from this work and stays
# off the shortlist by design.
#
# No `--limit` flag: the AIMD controller at
# `ingesta/clients/spotify_backfill_controller.py` reads its
# persisted state and picks the daily limit (starts at 200,
# ramps +200 every 3 ban-free days up to a hard ceiling of 800,
# drops on any ban observed in the shared metadata cooldown).
# Manual --limit overrides bypass the controller and are
# operator-only.
#
# Slot 05:00 UTC: separated from the 03:00 maintenance run so
# the two enrichment commands do not race for the shared
# metadata quota in the same minute. 05:00 also sits before the
# first `actualitzar_playlists_spotify` tick at 04:15... wait,
# actually 05:00 is AFTER 04:15. The playlist sync at 04:15
# already saw the night's spotify_ids from the 03:00
# maintenance run; the 05:00 backfill catches up the historical
# rebuigs without competing for the same slot.
#
# See docs/architecture/pipeline.md section 4 ("Backfill rate
# controller") for the full controller contract.
0 5 * * *   topquaranta   /home/topquaranta/bin/tq-run enriquir_spotify_rebuigs --shortlist-only --include-orfes >> /var/log/topquaranta/playlists.log 2>&1

# 22:30 → Pull engagement metrics from each social platform
# (Mastodon, Bluesky, Instagram, Telegram). Per-post counters for the
# last 30 days + per-account followers/posts. Fail-open on every
# external call so a Mastodon hiccup doesn't break the dashboard.
30 22 * * * topquaranta   /home/topquaranta/bin/tq-run recollir_metrics_social >> /var/log/topquaranta/analytics.log 2>&1

# Hourly → reconcile pending IG collaborator invitations (ADR-0015 §5.5).
# DORMANT: no-ops cleanly (exit 0) while
# ConfiguracioGlobal.ig_collaboradors_actiu is False (the default), so it
# stays fresh + green on the health dashboard. Ships in cron so activating
# the feature (tranche 3) needs no crontab edit.
0 * * * *   topquaranta   /home/topquaranta/bin/tq-run pollar_colaboracions_ig >> /var/log/topquaranta/analytics.log 2>&1

# 02:00 dilluns → Setmanal: neteja pendents òrfens (sense Deezer ID
# + sense tracks principals + ≥1 collab + 1 únic germà aprovat).
0 2 * * 1   topquaranta   /home/topquaranta/bin/tq-run netejar_pendents_orfes >> /var/log/topquaranta/neteja.log 2>&1

# 02:15 dilluns → Setmanal: descartar pendents col·lab sense ancoratge
# PPCC ni activitat staff. Tope 500 per execució (drena els ~1.8 k
# inicials en 4 setmanes).
15 2 * * 1  topquaranta   /home/topquaranta/bin/tq-run netejar_pendents_no_ppcc >> /var/log/topquaranta/neteja.log 2>&1

# 02:30 dilluns → Setmanal: xarxa de seguretat per a l'invariant de
# revisabilitat (informe 2a, 2026-06-07). Desactiva cançons pendents
# òrfenes (cap artista aprovat, contributors_raw buit) passada una marja
# de gràcia de 7 dies. Auto-curatiu sigui quina sigui la font de drift;
# el ganxo de de-aprovació de rebutjar_artista cobreix el camí de rebuig
# en temps real, açò captura la resta.
30 2 * * 1  topquaranta   /home/topquaranta/bin/tq-run netejar_cancons_orfes >> /var/log/topquaranta/neteja.log 2>&1

# 02:00 → Daily SEO inference: canonical genre + dona/home percent
# from MB+Last.fm tags. Cheap (~5 s for 2 k artistes); idempotent.
0 2 * * *   topquaranta   /home/topquaranta/bin/tq-run inferir_genere >> /var/log/topquaranta/seo.log 2>&1
5 2 * * *   topquaranta   /home/topquaranta/bin/tq-run inferir_percentatge_femeni >> /var/log/topquaranta/seo.log 2>&1

# 21:00 → SEO snapshots (Sprint S Bloc D, 2026-05-06).
#  - GSC: pulls T-2 day's search-analytics. Idempotent.
#  - PSI: 12 PageSpeed Insights calls (6 URLs × mobile+desktop).
0 21 * * *  topquaranta   /home/topquaranta/bin/tq-run recollir_metrics_gsc >> /var/log/topquaranta/seo.log 2>&1
30 21 * * * topquaranta   /home/topquaranta/bin/tq-run recollir_metrics_psi >> /var/log/topquaranta/seo.log 2>&1
# 21:15 → Bing Webmaster snapshot (traffic, queries, pages, crawl,
# inbound links). Skips cleanly without BING_WEBMASTER_API_KEY.
15 21 * * * topquaranta   /home/topquaranta/bin/tq-run recollir_metrics_bing >> /var/log/topquaranta/seo.log 2>&1

# 23:00 → Daily snapshot of pipeline-state gauges into MetricaPipeline
# (cançons verificades / pendents / rebutjades, cobertura whisper+MB,
# usuaris actius, distribució per territori). Idempotent — re-runs on
# the same day overwrite that day's row. Runs late so the values
# reflect the day's full activity (rebutjos, revisions, ingest).
0 23 * * *  topquaranta   /home/topquaranta/bin/tq-run snapshot_pipeline >> /var/log/topquaranta/analytics.log 2>&1

# 08:00 cada dilluns → email digest setmanal a admin@topquaranta.cat
# amb els KPIs de la setmana anterior. Envia amb EmailMultiAlternatives
# des de SERVER_EMAIL cap a ADMINS, via Brevo SMTP.
# (silenciat si una setmana qualsevol falla per Brevo down — el
# dashboard /staff/analytics no depèn d'aquest cron.)
0 8 * * 1   topquaranta   /home/topquaranta/bin/tq-run enviar_digest_setmanal >> /var/log/topquaranta/analytics.log 2>&1

# 23:30 → Generate the GoAccess HTML report from Caddy access logs
# (Caddy JSON → CLF → goaccess). Writes to /var/cache/topquaranta/
# goaccess/report.html, served back behind staff auth at
# /api/v1/staff/analytics/goaccess/. Last 30 days by default.
30 23 * * * topquaranta   /home/topquaranta/bin/tq-run generar_goaccess >> /var/log/topquaranta/analytics.log 2>&1

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Weekly
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Saturday 08:00 → official ranking for the just-finished ISO week.
0 8 * * 6   topquaranta   /home/topquaranta/bin/tq-run calcular_top >> /var/log/topquaranta/top.log 2>&1

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Operations & retention
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Recovery sweep: every 30 min detect missed/failed daily runs and
# relaunch them via tq-run. Capped at MAX_RECOVER_PER_DAY per command
# in tq-recover itself. (R7)
*/30 * * * * topquaranta   /home/topquaranta/bin/tq-recover >> /var/log/topquaranta/recover.log 2>&1

# Health watchdog — emails admin@ if any expected cron is STALE,
# STUCK, or FAILing. Silent when everything is OK. Caught 2026-05-01:
# `obtenir_novetats` had been hung for ~12 days while every hourly
# tick was reporting status=OK because the lock-skip path didn't
# distinguish itself from a successful run. Now that lock-skip exits
# 75 and `tq-run` writes status=SKIPPED_BY_LOCK without refreshing
# `last_run`, the same hang would surface within the command's
# max-age window (2 h for `obtenir_novetats`).
15 * * * *  topquaranta   /home/topquaranta/bin/tq-health --email-on-fail > /dev/null 2>&1

# Monthly: verify the latest daily backup is restorable. (R14)
30 4 1 * *  postgres      /home/topquaranta/bin/tq-restore-test >> /var/log/topquaranta/restore-test.log 2>&1

# Quarterly: archive SenyalDiari rows older than 2 years (Φ6 retention).
0 5 1 1,4,7,10 * topquaranta   /home/topquaranta/bin/tq-run arxivar_senyal_vell >> /var/log/topquaranta/arxivar.log 2>&1

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Sprint I — social distribution (Instagram)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Each entry below is gated by ConfiguracioGlobal.fase_distribucio:
# the entry runs unconditionally (cron-wise) but `publicar_social`
# marks the SocialPost as `omès` when the slot's min_fase exceeds
# the current value. Bumping `fase_distribucio` in /staff/social
# enables the next slot without touching this file.
#
# Phase 1: Saturday only (PPCC feed + stories) — runs after
# `calcular_top` has produced the official setmanal ranking.
30 9 * * 6  topquaranta  /home/topquaranta/bin/tq-run publicar_social >> /var/log/topquaranta/social.log 2>&1
# Phase 2+: territorial rotatori dimecres
30 9 * * 3  topquaranta  /home/topquaranta/bin/tq-run publicar_social >> /var/log/topquaranta/social.log 2>&1
# Phase 3+: second territorial dilluns
30 9 * * 1  topquaranta  /home/topquaranta/bin/tq-run publicar_social >> /var/log/topquaranta/social.log 2>&1
# Phase 4+: nous singles divendres
0 10 * * 5  topquaranta  /home/topquaranta/bin/tq-run publicar_social >> /var/log/topquaranta/social.log 2>&1
# Phase 5+: nous àlbums dimarts
0 10 * * 2  topquaranta  /home/topquaranta/bin/tq-run publicar_social >> /var/log/topquaranta/social.log 2>&1
# Monthly token refresh (1st of month, 03:00 UTC).
0 3 1 * *   topquaranta  /home/topquaranta/bin/tq-run renovar_token_instagram >> /var/log/topquaranta/social.log 2>&1

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Sprint I bis: multi-channel distribution (Mastodon, Bluesky, Newsletter)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Each channel has its own kill switch in ConfiguracioGlobal. The
# cron entries fire unconditionally; the command short-circuits when
# the relevant switch is off. Times are offset 5-30 min after the
# Instagram cron so the IG post lands first (visibility) and the
# other channels echo it shortly after.

# Mastodon — same calendar as Instagram, +10 min after each slot.
40 9 * * 6  topquaranta  /home/topquaranta/bin/tq-run publicar_canal --channel mastodon >> /var/log/topquaranta/social.log 2>&1
40 9 * * 3  topquaranta  /home/topquaranta/bin/tq-run publicar_canal --channel mastodon >> /var/log/topquaranta/social.log 2>&1
40 9 * * 1  topquaranta  /home/topquaranta/bin/tq-run publicar_canal --channel mastodon >> /var/log/topquaranta/social.log 2>&1
10 10 * * 5 topquaranta  /home/topquaranta/bin/tq-run publicar_canal --channel mastodon >> /var/log/topquaranta/social.log 2>&1
10 10 * * 2 topquaranta  /home/topquaranta/bin/tq-run publicar_canal --channel mastodon >> /var/log/topquaranta/social.log 2>&1

# Bluesky — same calendar, +20 min.
50 9 * * 6  topquaranta  /home/topquaranta/bin/tq-run publicar_canal --channel bluesky >> /var/log/topquaranta/social.log 2>&1
50 9 * * 3  topquaranta  /home/topquaranta/bin/tq-run publicar_canal --channel bluesky >> /var/log/topquaranta/social.log 2>&1
50 9 * * 1  topquaranta  /home/topquaranta/bin/tq-run publicar_canal --channel bluesky >> /var/log/topquaranta/social.log 2>&1
20 10 * * 5 topquaranta  /home/topquaranta/bin/tq-run publicar_canal --channel bluesky >> /var/log/topquaranta/social.log 2>&1
20 10 * * 2 topquaranta  /home/topquaranta/bin/tq-run publicar_canal --channel bluesky >> /var/log/topquaranta/social.log 2>&1

# Telegram — same calendar, +25 min. Sends the full carousel
# (Telegram supports up to 10 photos per media group).
55 9 * * 6  topquaranta  /home/topquaranta/bin/tq-run publicar_canal --channel telegram >> /var/log/topquaranta/social.log 2>&1
55 9 * * 3  topquaranta  /home/topquaranta/bin/tq-run publicar_canal --channel telegram >> /var/log/topquaranta/social.log 2>&1
55 9 * * 1  topquaranta  /home/topquaranta/bin/tq-run publicar_canal --channel telegram >> /var/log/topquaranta/social.log 2>&1
25 10 * * 5 topquaranta  /home/topquaranta/bin/tq-run publicar_canal --channel telegram >> /var/log/topquaranta/social.log 2>&1
25 10 * * 2 topquaranta  /home/topquaranta/bin/tq-run publicar_canal --channel telegram >> /var/log/topquaranta/social.log 2>&1

# Newsletter — opt-out review flow (2026-06-07). Only the weekly top
# global goes by email (spamming subscribers 5×/week is a fast unsub
# trigger). Steps:
#   - The cloud routine (set up separately) reads
#     /api/v1/newsletter-routine/brief/ and leaves the draft via
#     /api/v1/newsletter-routine/esborrany/ (font=llm) sometime Saturday.
#   - Saturday 16:00: ENGINE FALLBACK. generar_esborrany_newsletter only
#     creates a draft if none exists for the week, so it runs LATE enough
#     for the routine to have had its turn; if the routine failed, the
#     engine still leaves a draft. calcular_top (08:00, can finish ~10:30)
#     is consolidated well before, and an anti-stale guard refuses to
#     build from last week's top if this week isn't consolidated.
#   - Sunday 10:00: send the draft (subject + narrative, possibly
#     edited) unless cancelled, rebuilding the list from the final top.
